OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FAfter a wet
OL,6,Fand cloudy day, a clear and dry night
OL,7,Fto follow for many. Although, showers
OL,8,Fcontinuing to affect coastal areas.
OL,9,FFeeling chilly in rural spots inland.
OL,10,
OL,11,CThursday:FA clear and cool start for
OL,12,Fmany, showers lingering along the
OL,13,Fcoast. Cloud gradually thickens
OL,14,Fthroughout the day, with rain and
OL,15,Fstrengthening winds arriving during
OL,16,Fthe evening and continuing overnight.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
OL,24,ANext Page  BWeather  CReg News  FReg TV
