OL,3,GEast Midlands
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FWet and
OL,6,Fcloudy Friday morning, clearing by the
OL,7,Fafternoon, sunny spells with isolated
OL,8,Fblustery showers to follow. Remaining
OL,9,Fshowery and breezy on Saturday.
OL,10,FBecoming drier and more settled on
OL,11,FSunday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
